FBoS Release No: 63, 2018 
2017 Population and Housing Census, Release 2 
Page 1 
FBoS Release No: 63, 2018         21st September, 2018 
2017 Population and Housing Census 
Infographics Release 
This Infographics release aims to meet the objective of increas ing awareness and 
understanding of statistics that has been produced from information gathered during the 
Census exercise.  It therefore provides visual representations of Census information and is 
intended to allow users to easily digest information through the use of visual data, charts, and 
statistics. T he dissemination of information using info graphics provides an ideal mix of 
design that is visually compelling whilst at the same time communicating complex data in a 
manner that is easy to understand. 
The information sheets in this release was designed and produced with Technical Assistance 
from UNFPA in collaboration with Professional S taff of FBoS. The following outputs are 
presented; 
i. P
opulation by Gender by Tikina
ii. Population 3 years and above with at least one disability by Division
iii. Number of Businesses and Households by Division
iv. Location of Registered Businesses by Industries
v. E
conomic Activity by Division
vi. Educational A ttainment by Division
vii. Informal Housing by Division
In
formation from the 2017 Population and Housing Census will be released progressively in 
the coming months. 
Mr. Epeli Waqavonovono 
Government Statistician and Census Commissioner

